{
  "name": "Kiss of the Spider Queen",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can channel the Spider Queen's malevolence into a deadly kiss. As an Action, you touch a creature within your reach. The target takes 12d10 poison or psychic damage (your choice), or half as much on a successful Constitution save. A creature Charmed by you has Disadvantage on its Saving Throw. After you use this ability, you cannot cast it again until you complete a Long Rest.</p>",
